--[[
Traceless Roblox UI Library
LocalScript / loadstring style

Use:
local Library = loadstring(game:HttpGet("RAW_GITHUB_LINK_HERE"))()

Recommended loader:
Library:SetWorkerUrl("https://YOUR-WORKER.YOUR-SUBDOMAIN.workers.dev")

Features:
- Returns Library table
- Compact black/gray UI
- Reopen button when closed
- Tabs + basic custom controls
- Traceless chat component
- Uses request({ Url, Method, Headers, Body }) internally
- Sends requests to your Cloudflare Worker backend
- Cloudflare handles OpenAI keys, D1 plan verification, request limits, and access removal
- API status label: Cloudflare / requests left / errors
- Clear Chat button
- Basic/Pro plan display
- Optional plan switching through config.AllowPlanSwitching
- Select Game Item -> click object -> confirm -> inserts object context into chat textbox
- Editable + scrollable code blocks
- Copy Code and Copy Reply
- GUI displays Traceless, and Cloudflare checks the saved player plan/server-side OpenAI model

Important:
- Normal Roblox Studio LocalScripts do not have request().
- This is for environments that provide request().
- Do not publish OpenAI API keys in client code. The OpenAI key stays in Cloudflare secrets.
]]

